              "message": "Merge upstream main into dds-import-options\n\nUpstream's DocumentFormat refactor (banded TIFF import, #8169) subsumes this\nbranch's image_kind helper; import_dds_levels now asks document_format for\nthe target layout and sample type. The DDS modal coexists with the new\nsmart_svg_ui polls, and file-format-parity keeps both histories.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
